                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7dda2f5-b8bf-45fa-80e8-19a6945ed035",
                                                "sense_id": "b12d9dc6-5ef1-38a2-974b-284b3c27af58",
                                                "text": "surplus words"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44193cd6-94c6-4ffe-b76f-c4515b1ddd10",
                                                "sense_id": "b12d9dc6-5ef1-38a2-974b-284b3c27af58",
                                                "text": "The latest shipment of goods is surplus to our needs."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e7d3f86-e87d-4500-b683-020cb6239927",
                                                "sense_id": "b12d9dc6-5ef1-38a2-974b-284b3c27af58",
                                                "text": "But to return to where we left her, I see her still, propped up in a kind of stupor against one of the walls in which this wretched edifice abounds, her long grey greasy hair framing in its cowl of scrofulous mats a face where pallor, languor, hunger, acne, recent dirt, immemorial chagrin and surplus hair seemed to dispute the mastery."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "05f92864-94f7-4423-827b-2b86a6a60e39",
                                                "sense_id": "b12d9dc6-5ef1-38a2-974b-284b3c27af58",
                                                "text": "An artificial kidney these days still means a refrigerator-sized dialysis machine. Such devices mimic the way real kidneys cleanse blood and eject impurities and surplus water as urine."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
